EXCEPTION

One bundle in this repository is NOT under the MIT licence:

  dsw/examples/2d-materials/graphene-md/

It links the LAMMPS molecular-dynamics library, which is GPL-2.0-or-later, so
the combined work is GPL-2.0-or-later. Its own LICENSE file carries the full
text, and NOTICE.md explains the boundary. Everything else here - the DSW host,
the plugin ABI, and every other plugin - is MIT as above.

Interatomic potential parameter files under
dsw/examples/2d-materials/graphene-md/potentials/ come from the LAMMPS
distribution and from OpenKIM and carry their own terms; LICENSE.CDDL in that
folder applies to the files that name it.

